WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.244
Debbo'en go'o ɗon mari innde dow wakkati.

00:00:03.324 --> 00:00:08.108
To Bobo-Dioulasso, goomu Guimbi Ouattara ɗon waɗa haa jooni.

00:00:08.188 --> 00:00:17.188
Ngam faamugo taariika maako, sey a hoodi diga karnijum 19th, wakkati nde gariiri ɗon nodda bee innde feere: Sya.

00:00:17.268 --> 00:00:21.323
Guimbi wari nder ummaatoore Ouattara, yimɓe Dioula.

00:00:21.403 --> 00:00:26.998
Maamiraaɓe ɓe'e njooɗi nokkuure nde'e nder nguurndam siyasa e jaaynde.

00:00:27.078 --> 00:00:32.997
Goonga, Guimbi anndinaama ngam anndal maako, baawɗe maako, e dokkal maako.

00:00:33.077 --> 00:00:35.754
Wakkati nde'e ɗum wakkati caɗeele.

00:00:35.834 --> 00:00:42.888
Dowlaaji ɗo'o ɗon haɓɓa bee konu, laamiiɓe laamooɓe ɗon ɗaɓɓa ngam ɓe ɓesda laamu maɓɓe.

00:00:42.968 --> 00:00:55.049
Guimbi Ouattara ɗon wi'a ko o mari darnde mawnde nder hakkilantaago berniwol: o jaɓii yimɓe ɗo'o, o toroo ardiiɓe, o haɓɓi bee yimɓe ɓe ɗon haani Sya.

00:00:55.129 --> 00:01:08.994
Yimɓe Orop ɓe njehi nder nokkuure nde'e to cappanɗe sappo e njoweego ujineere, mbi'i e dow debbo gooduɗo semmbe, mo jaɓɓinooɓe yimɓe ɓeen, o jeyaa dow goɗɗum nder berniwol.

00:01:09.074 --> 00:01:17.587
Taariihalaaɓe ɗon njogii haala baawɗe maako: o laamiiɗo nder ma'ana maako, koo debbo mo yimɓe fuu mawnina?

00:01:17.667 --> 00:01:20.911
Fooyre fooyre naa' wakkati fuu ina walli.

00:01:20.991 --> 00:01:23.992
Ko haani woni, ɗum ɓeydi habaru maako.

00:01:24.072 --> 00:01:30.072
E nder Bobo-Dioulasso, innde maako ɗon holla cembiɗol, weltaare e hakkillo.

00:01:30.152 --> 00:01:39.801
Haala maako holli haala gootol: nder sahaaji ɓurɗi ɓennuɗi, debbo o mari baawɗe nder ummaatooje, o hakkiilo yimɓe maako.
